{"id":"vod_sn_36592","vodId":"36592","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"少女与战车","name_cn":"少女与战车","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/1600bb1e80c086b23e1022a89363e40e.jpg"},"summary":"出生于坦克世家的高中少女西住美穗（渕上舞 配音），早已厌烦了被作为传统文化在世界范围内普及、号称修炼女性的“战车道”。为了逃避这个恼人的宿命，美穗特意转学至没有这一科目的大洗，并结交了渴望浪漫爱情的武部沙织（茅野爱衣 配音）和擅长花道的五十铃华（尾崎真实 配音）两位好友。谁知日本即将举行战车道大赛，美穗所在的大戏女子学园也顺应恢复了战车道的科目。由于相关经验学院短缺，在学生会长强迫之下，美穗和两位朋友一同选修战车道。对于这门停滞已久的学科，18名少女们寻找废弃战车、维修护理、进修操作和作战课程、实战演习……，如此等等，一切都从头开始。　　经过一段时间的艰苦磨练，大洗女子学园的少女们驾驶着神采奕奕的战车，开向了高手如云的全国大赛会场……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:44:28","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Dy5tRyHasr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3ffRKWsMnS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0xu8U21EDf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/APYnjpSJpU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/9s4Wuq8rNy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/YdfTCJrSp51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/nYKWxVrSiK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/HEKfB75A5N1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Rd73ChMiEZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/VtwFWYQZWN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wB5WyQQfTm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Wa2c5qjxpr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/KrPsNvr1D31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/UYSWQHEHeQ